      "id": "sol.amc-8-2009-p3.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "From the graph, we can see that Suzanna rides \\(3\\) miles in \\(15\\) minutes. This means that in \\(30\\) minutes, she will have ridden \\(6\\) miles.\n\nThus, C is the correct answer.",
